# Empery stack smoke (Rest Client) — host services on localhost when compose is up

@host = http://127.0.0.1

### EIC (empery_intelligence_core) health
GET {{host}}:8007/api/v1/health

### ECC (empery_control_center_api) health
GET {{host}}:8006/api/v1/health

### Desktop shell health
GET {{host}}:8020/api/v1/health

### ai_chat lifecycle-meta via EIC factory
GET {{host}}:8007/api/v1/factory/services/ai_chat/lifecycle-meta

### ai_chat lifecycle-meta via ECC proxy
GET {{host}}:8006/api/v1/services/ai_chat/lifecycle-meta
